You are extracting data for a systematic literature review (PRISMA 2020) on "Agentic AI for Autonomous Cybersecurity: From Intrusion Detection to Autonomous Incident Response".
For the paper below, fill each field FACTUALLY, in the paper's own terms, briefly (one or two short phrases). Do not classify into categories of your own, do not evaluate or critique: report only what the paper states.
Write "not stated" when the paper does not say. Fields:
- study_type: what kind of paper it is, as the paper itself presents it (e.g. system with evaluation, survey, conceptual framework, benchmark)
- RQ1 task_stage: the security task(s) the system performs, in the paper's words
- RQ1 domain: the deployment setting (e.g. enterprise network, cloud, ICS/OT, IoT, web apps)
